Z||000002||LarryB||11-15-2000||04:58 PM||||Used to be an EMT-MAST.  My old college roommate used to be an EMT-A out of Westbrook but that was quite a while ago (he's an MD now).  There's a definite pecking order, those with higher ratings and/or more experience usually got the more exciting/interesting calls.  *Usually*.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>My friend had a story about a naked drunk girl, except she was 16 and had slipped down the stairs and broken her leg.  Being covered in Wesson Oil with 2 drunken guys in the house probably had something to do with it. <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by alpha:<BR><B>I was just curious if there are any other EMTs in the forum? <P>I am currently an EMT-Basic and run with the University of Maine Ambulance, which means I mostly deal with naked, drunk people.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
